    "observationBoundary": {
      "const": "One BizHawk launch enters the original CheckSram call, redirects only its post-return continuation through a work-RAM thunk, and executes the original SaveGame, LoadGame, CopySave, ClearSaveSlotFlag, flag-88 branch, j_BattleLoop alias, and BattleLoop effective target. The observer writes and poisons only in-process COMBATANT_DATA and GAME_FLAGS control state, then reads the emulator SRAM domain through the distinct parsed physical-window base. It does not assert cross-process persistence, power-loss/partial writes, pixels, audio, or input cadence."
